WEBVTT

00:00.080 --> 00:08.480
Christmas in Your City

00:00.960 --> 00:04.570
Look at these stunning winter lights!

00:04.570 --> 00:08.490
The streets are just bustling with
couples enjoying the Christmas spirit.

00:08.480 --> 00:14.890
Christmas in Your City

00:08.490 --> 00:10.590
Aren't you two a happy couple?

00:10.590 --> 00:12.070
Why, thank you.

00:10.950 --> 00:14.290
Ugh, just kill me now.

00:12.070 --> 00:14.900
Getting to see the lights with my
girlfriend is a dream come true.

00:14.900 --> 00:17.080
She seems to be a little camera shy.

00:17.080 --> 00:19.470
Hey, stop! Come on, quit it!

00:18.910 --> 00:22.360
On days like these, at least we've
got video games to keep us company.

00:19.470 --> 00:21.770
Quick, get a close-up!

00:22.920 --> 00:24.290
Right, Mihari?

00:24.290 --> 00:26.750
Don't lump me in with you.

00:28.050 --> 00:30.330
Besides, I happen to have a date.

00:33.630 --> 00:35.330
Say what?!

00:54.730 --> 00:55.820
ONIMAI: I'm Now Your Sister

00:59.610 --> 01:02.740
Mahiro Oyama

02:03.760 --> 02:12.060
ONIMAI: I'm Now Your Sister

02:16.520 --> 02:21.450
#09 Mahiro Rings in the New Year

02:29.400 --> 02:31.250
S-So...

02:31.770 --> 02:35.540
What made you call me out
here today of all days?

02:35.540 --> 02:37.470
It's a date! What else?!

02:37.470 --> 02:38.160
What?!

02:38.160 --> 02:40.770
Since when did Mihari have the time?

02:40.770 --> 02:42.910
I gotta see this sweet-talker
with my own two eyes.

02:42.910 --> 02:45.460
O-Oh, you meant hers...

02:46.130 --> 02:49.610
I need you to be my escort.
Too many people, you know?

02:56.320 --> 02:58.430
S-Someone's coming!

02:59.460 --> 03:01.790
Sorry!

03:01.790 --> 03:03.960
I got caught up!

03:05.380 --> 03:06.840
The audacity!

03:06.840 --> 03:08.400
I'm sorry, okay?

03:08.400 --> 03:09.980
What took you so long?

03:09.980 --> 03:11.920
It took me a bit to get ready.

03:09.980 --> 03:12.210
Wait... Onee-chan?

03:11.920 --> 03:14.130
Fine, I'll let it slide.

03:14.130 --> 03:16.260
Thanks, bestie.

03:14.190 --> 03:15.570
Jeez!

03:16.260 --> 03:18.520
'Course. Come on, let's go!

03:16.970 --> 03:21.020
I knew it couldn't have been a real date!

03:18.520 --> 03:19.360
Yeah!

03:21.020 --> 03:23.480
Honestly, what was she
thinking calling it that?

03:23.480 --> 03:25.530
You really love your sister, huh?

03:25.530 --> 03:27.480
Welp, that's a relief.

03:27.480 --> 03:29.150
Time to head home.

03:29.150 --> 03:30.390
What?!

03:32.020 --> 03:34.040
W-We're here now anyway.

03:34.040 --> 03:36.820
Why don't we follow them
a little while longer?

03:37.500 --> 03:40.830
M-Maybe there's more to their
relationship than meets the eye!

03:40.830 --> 03:43.290
Who are you, Miyo-chan?

03:45.710 --> 03:48.790
Still, I guess it would be
rude of me to call it off

03:48.790 --> 03:52.010
after she came all this way out for me...

03:53.550 --> 03:55.300
Okay, you're on!

03:55.300 --> 03:56.830
The pursuit continues!

03:57.700 --> 03:58.580
Hurray!

03:58.960 --> 04:00.450
They'll love it!

04:04.380 --> 04:05.570
Something wrong?

04:05.570 --> 04:07.920
Oh, just my imagination.

04:07.920 --> 04:09.050
Shall we go?

04:10.640 --> 04:13.080
There are so many places to check out!

04:13.080 --> 04:15.080
For real! Where should we start?

04:28.450 --> 04:30.290
Sorry for the wait!

04:48.880 --> 04:50.400
Ready, go!

04:53.430 --> 04:54.400
Well?

04:54.400 --> 04:55.300
It's perfect!

05:00.230 --> 05:03.200
Looks like two friends shopping to me.

05:03.200 --> 05:04.810
I figured.

05:06.370 --> 05:09.170
Tailing them is starting
to get a little old.

05:09.170 --> 05:11.550
I'm getting tired too. Wanna head back?

05:11.550 --> 05:13.910
Wait, but... uh...

05:13.910 --> 05:17.080
Oh, I know! Why don't we
do some shopping too?!

05:17.480 --> 05:19.230
You could pick stuff out for me!

05:19.230 --> 05:20.510
What?!

05:21.080 --> 05:24.190
Come on! You always seem to know what to wear.

05:24.190 --> 05:26.420
O-Okay...

05:26.780 --> 05:30.650
Hang on. Now it's like
<i>we're</i> the ones on a date!

05:30.650 --> 05:33.290
Momiji's bound to be mistaken
for my boyfriend, too.

05:33.290 --> 05:35.340
Hey! What about something like this?

05:36.120 --> 05:37.260
Look!

05:44.100 --> 05:47.850
N-No way! Absolutely not!

05:47.850 --> 05:50.030
Fine, if this is how it has to be...

05:56.860 --> 05:59.630
She looks cute! Hurray!

06:02.540 --> 06:05.580
The skirt's too short, though!

06:06.890 --> 06:09.470
No one's gonna mistake her for a boy now.

06:09.840 --> 06:12.410
Can't you pick out something less feminine?

06:12.410 --> 06:14.120
No! That's the whole point!

06:14.120 --> 06:14.890
What?

06:16.730 --> 06:17.830
Oh!

06:17.830 --> 06:19.590
Here! Try this one on, too!

06:19.590 --> 06:22.810
Really?! But I'm not into frilly stuff!

06:22.810 --> 06:25.290
Come on! You might as well!

06:25.290 --> 06:27.730
Wait a sec, Mahiro-chan!

06:25.880 --> 06:27.730
Just trust me, okay?

06:29.480 --> 06:31.150
Wait. Onii—

06:31.150 --> 06:33.880
Mahiro-chan? What brings you here?

06:34.220 --> 06:35.950
Shoot! They found us!

06:35.950 --> 06:38.870
You've been following us the
whole time, haven't you?

06:38.870 --> 06:40.380
You noticed, huh?

06:40.380 --> 06:42.130
Nothing gets past you, Kaede-chan.

06:42.640 --> 06:44.570
Momiji's with you too, isn't she?

06:44.570 --> 06:45.910
Where could she be?

06:45.910 --> 06:47.650
What? You're on a date?

06:47.650 --> 06:48.750
As <i>if</i>!

06:50.140 --> 06:51.140
Aha!

06:52.140 --> 06:53.660
Wait! She's—

06:53.660 --> 06:56.100
Let's look behind curtain number one!

07:03.370 --> 07:04.960
My goodness...

07:06.310 --> 07:07.610
She's adorable!

07:07.610 --> 07:09.900
Totally! Cute as a button!

07:13.640 --> 07:15.870
On second thought, I'm kinda feeling this!

07:15.870 --> 07:16.750
Um...

07:16.750 --> 07:19.030
Oh, no! She's having an awakening!

07:26.400 --> 07:29.540
Well, we got what
we came for on our end.

07:29.540 --> 07:31.080
What shall we do now?

07:31.080 --> 07:33.440
Why don't we hang out for a bit?

07:33.440 --> 07:35.410
Can't go wasting an opportunity like this.

07:35.870 --> 07:37.840
Can we, Mahiro-chan?

09:51.510 --> 09:53.690
I'm so glad I got to see this with you guys!

10:08.600 --> 10:09.920
We're home!

10:11.300 --> 10:14.470
Look at you, you go-getter!

10:14.470 --> 10:16.310
Since when did you two start dating?

10:16.310 --> 10:18.850
Quit joking around, will you?

10:18.850 --> 10:21.200
Why'd you lie about having a date, anyway?!

10:21.200 --> 10:24.250
You could've just <i>told</i> me you and
Kaede-chan were going shopping!

10:26.050 --> 10:28.680
Don't tell me... you were worried about me?

10:28.680 --> 10:31.690
Perish the thought!

10:35.090 --> 10:36.740
Hey, I'm sorry.

10:36.740 --> 10:40.290
I did have a reason for
keeping it from you, though.

10:40.290 --> 10:42.530
I had Kaede help me pick something out.

10:57.440 --> 11:00.920
Merry Christmas, Onii-chan!

11:16.100 --> 11:18.880
I wanted to surprise you!

11:25.530 --> 11:27.140
Honestly...

11:27.140 --> 11:28.950
She really had me fooled.

11:28.950 --> 11:30.870
Oh, and FYI...

11:31.180 --> 11:32.990
We got a matching one for Momiji-chan, too.

11:32.990 --> 11:33.850
Huh?

11:35.300 --> 11:37.650
Why would you do that?

11:45.090 --> 11:45.220
ONIMAI

11:45.380 --> 11:46.650
Onimai.

11:54.520 --> 11:57.940
Happy New Year

12:01.710 --> 12:03.280
Here, open wide.

12:05.760 --> 12:07.870
You really pulled out all the stops.

12:07.870 --> 12:10.390
You got the kotatsu out and everything.

12:10.390 --> 12:13.800
Well, I thought we should at least
have it out for New Year's.

12:13.800 --> 12:15.980
I can't believe the year's almost over.

12:22.670 --> 12:28.140
Celebrating the New Year around Japan

12:22.920 --> 12:25.200
Happy New Year!

12:25.200 --> 12:25.970
Coming up...

12:25.760 --> 12:28.140
It's midnight, Onii-chan!

12:25.970 --> 12:28.140
We'll be taking a look at the New
Year's celebrations around Japan.

12:29.050 --> 12:31.290
Happy New Year!

12:31.290 --> 12:33.140
Happy New Year!

12:35.460 --> 12:38.730
Can I get my New Year's
money now, sister dearest?

12:40.060 --> 12:42.420
Of course, sweetie!

12:43.900 --> 12:45.490
Easy win, guys.

12:52.630 --> 12:55.740
That's way too few zeros! I'm in
middle school now, you know?!

12:55.740 --> 12:58.080
No, you're a grown adult, Onii-chan.

12:58.520 --> 13:00.360
Oh, that's right...

13:00.360 --> 13:02.260
He's starting to lose it...

13:02.260 --> 13:04.480
Here's hoping life as a girl
treats you well this year too!

13:04.480 --> 13:05.460
You got this!

13:06.500 --> 13:09.220
I'll turn back to normal someday! I swear!

13:13.500 --> 13:18.650
Ah, what a wonderful New
Year's Day for staying in.

13:24.500 --> 13:26.360
I'm hungry.

13:26.360 --> 13:28.700
Morning! I made mochi soup.

13:35.650 --> 13:37.530
We're not having osechi?

13:37.530 --> 13:39.280
It's a hassle to prep, you know?

13:39.280 --> 13:40.280
Were you looking forward to it?

13:40.280 --> 13:43.720
Not really. I think I can live without it.

13:46.260 --> 13:51.690
As long as I can stuff my face
and nap all day, I'll be happy.

13:53.450 --> 13:56.660
Being productive has its
rewards too, you know?

13:56.660 --> 13:58.050
But still...

13:59.090 --> 14:02.960
I guess it is nice to kick your
feet up every once in a while.

14:02.960 --> 14:03.610
Oh?

14:03.610 --> 14:05.880
So you finally see where I'm coming from!

14:05.880 --> 14:08.490
Look at you! I'm so proud!

14:11.510 --> 14:13.800
B-Be that as it may!

14:14.570 --> 14:17.480
Come, Onii-chan. It's time to get dressed.

14:19.670 --> 14:22.670
W-Wait, don't tell me...!

14:35.400 --> 14:37.550
We gotta ring in the new year!

14:37.550 --> 14:40.360
It's the most crowded place
you could have taken me...

14:48.190 --> 14:51.170
Hey, look, shrine maidens.

14:51.170 --> 14:53.640
Come on, snap out of it!

14:53.640 --> 14:55.200
Quit retreating to your happy place!

14:55.580 --> 14:58.020
I prepared a little incentive for you.

14:58.370 --> 15:00.200
You did?

15:00.200 --> 15:01.610
Oh, there they are!

15:01.610 --> 15:03.460
Happy New Year!

15:03.460 --> 15:05.540
My incentive is <i>here</i>!

15:06.670 --> 15:08.530
You look stunning, Kaede!

15:09.980 --> 15:12.560
I managed to score a cute rental.

15:17.150 --> 15:19.220
I-Is she a samurai?

15:19.670 --> 15:22.310
She refused to wear anything else...

15:22.640 --> 15:24.400
Don't I look cool?

15:24.400 --> 15:27.720
Oh, she must be going through a phase.

15:28.110 --> 15:32.060
I hope you find yourself soon. All the best.

15:33.840 --> 15:35.310
Let's get going, then!

15:35.310 --> 15:36.490
We gotta get in line.

15:36.490 --> 15:37.660
Coming!

15:41.760 --> 15:44.550
You should've worn a kimono too, Mihari!

15:44.550 --> 15:45.530
Yeah!

15:45.530 --> 15:47.850
How come you get to dress
normally and I don't?

15:47.850 --> 15:51.010
I-I wouldn't look good in one anyway...

15:55.480 --> 15:57.530
We finally made it!

16:01.670 --> 16:04.570
I better get my money's worth
for standing in line so long!

16:04.570 --> 16:06.880
Now you're just being greedy.

16:07.610 --> 16:10.170
I wish for my brother to
live a respectable life.

16:10.630 --> 16:13.410
I wish that we can all stay
close with each other.

16:14.350 --> 16:15.150
Go on!

16:15.150 --> 16:16.260
You too, Mahiro-chan.

16:16.260 --> 16:17.610
R-Right...

16:21.670 --> 16:23.030
I wish...

16:35.720 --> 16:38.140
No. 50

16:35.720 --> 16:38.140
Omikuji

16:35.720 --> 16:38.140
Great Blessing

16:35.720 --> 16:38.140
Fortune

16:38.400 --> 16:40.540
Yay! I got the best one!

16:40.540 --> 16:44.620
Pretty weird for a science geek to
get all excited about her fortune.

16:44.620 --> 16:47.170
Doesn't mean I can't participate!

16:47.170 --> 16:48.470
Hey, wait...

16:48.470 --> 16:51.220
Which is better? A small
blessing or a great one?

16:51.960 --> 16:53.280
Asahi?

16:54.150 --> 16:56.050
Wait, Mahiro-chan?

16:59.410 --> 17:01.720
Hey, Miyo-chan! Hey, Asahi!

17:01.720 --> 17:02.750
Happy New Year!

17:02.750 --> 17:05.660
Happy New Year!

17:05.660 --> 17:07.380
Your kimono's so cute!

17:07.380 --> 17:09.830
Oh, shush! So is yours, Miyo-chan!

17:10.190 --> 17:12.210
So we meet again, Momijiro!

17:14.700 --> 17:16.520
Why are you in men's hakama?

17:16.520 --> 17:18.480
W-Well, you know...

17:18.480 --> 17:20.180
I think they look cool...

17:21.880 --> 17:24.160
The little ones are all here!

17:24.160 --> 17:25.190
I know!

17:25.190 --> 17:26.590
Bet you can't beat me at target shooting!

17:26.590 --> 17:28.220
Hey!

17:29.200 --> 17:31.140
You gotta save me, Mahiro-chan!

17:31.490 --> 17:33.150
Oh, my...

17:33.150 --> 17:34.400
Oh la la...

17:46.450 --> 17:50.370
A Precious World

17:46.450 --> 17:50.370
To A New Year

17:46.450 --> 17:50.370
A Clear Sky

18:01.020 --> 18:02.680
I think I'm hungry.

18:02.680 --> 18:04.950
Wanna get something from the food stalls?

18:04.950 --> 18:07.040
I don't have any more money!

18:07.040 --> 18:09.030
Then why not come over to our place?

18:09.030 --> 18:11.070
I went overboard on the osechi, anyway.

18:11.070 --> 18:13.280
Kaede-chan's homemade osechi?!

18:13.280 --> 18:15.470
Let's go! What are we waiting for?!

18:15.480 --> 18:17.280
ONIMAI

18:17.480 --> 18:17.650
ONIMAI

18:21.340 --> 18:23.400
Wow!

18:23.640 --> 18:26.340
Kaede-chan's homemade osechi!

18:26.540 --> 18:28.430
It's a good thing you guys are here.

18:28.430 --> 18:30.280
I may have made a little too much.

18:30.280 --> 18:33.080
I told you you were overworking yourself!

18:33.520 --> 18:35.980
New Year's isn't quite the
same without it, huh?

18:35.980 --> 18:38.250
Maybe I should have made some after all.

18:39.540 --> 18:43.670
Every osechi dish has a special
meaning behind it, right?

18:43.670 --> 18:46.600
Rolled konbu represents
"yorokobu," or happiness.

18:46.960 --> 18:49.460
I get it! Yorokonbu!

18:52.470 --> 18:53.830
And black beans...

18:54.450 --> 18:56.210
bring good health so that you can work hard.

18:56.210 --> 18:57.370
All right!

18:57.370 --> 18:59.930
Good luck working hard, then, Onee-chan!

19:03.540 --> 19:07.280
And since rolled omelettes resemble scrolls,
they're said to bring academic success.

19:07.550 --> 19:10.200
So good luck with your studies, Mahiro-chan!

19:10.990 --> 19:11.970
Here!

19:13.070 --> 19:15.350
Th-Thank you...

19:22.910 --> 19:25.200
Thanks for the meal!

19:26.160 --> 19:28.620
I'm happy you liked it!

19:28.620 --> 19:30.550
We have amazake too, if you want.

19:31.330 --> 19:33.390
I don't think I've ever tried it!

19:33.390 --> 19:36.270
You're still too young
to drink alcohol, Doc!

19:36.270 --> 19:38.640
Actually, it's generally okay
for minors to drink it.

19:38.640 --> 19:39.830
In small amounts, that is.

19:39.830 --> 19:41.790
Since the alcohol is cooked off anyway.

19:41.790 --> 19:43.730
Yeah, so it's totally legal.

19:44.000 --> 19:46.520
There you go. Try some.

19:56.690 --> 19:57.460
Um...

19:58.310 --> 19:59.360
Mihari?

20:05.000 --> 20:08.410
Onii-chan!

20:08.410 --> 20:10.630
W-Watch it, you dummy!

20:10.630 --> 20:12.240
There are people around!

20:12.240 --> 20:14.350
What? Just from amazake?!

20:14.600 --> 20:15.670
Come on, claws off.

20:16.270 --> 20:18.620
She's your sister, remember?

20:18.620 --> 20:20.280
Boo!

20:20.500 --> 20:23.100
Then I'll take you instead!

20:28.960 --> 20:31.120
She's on a drunken rampage!

20:31.580 --> 20:33.530
Everyone, fall back!

20:33.530 --> 20:37.460
Take refuge in Momiji's room
before she can launch an attack!

20:40.090 --> 20:41.990
You too, Miyo-chan! Hurry!

20:42.480 --> 20:45.010
I can't. I'm...

20:46.680 --> 20:48.880
My eyes are locked on, and I can't move!

20:52.810 --> 20:54.610
No! Miyo-chan!

20:54.610 --> 20:57.480
Miyo-chan!

21:04.900 --> 21:05.960
She's awake!

21:05.960 --> 21:08.160
A-Are you all right?

21:08.160 --> 21:09.710
Huh?

21:09.710 --> 21:12.780
What happened just now?

21:14.510 --> 21:17.470
You're banned from alcohol
for life, that's what.

21:21.010 --> 21:22.800
Onee-sama!

21:40.930 --> 21:44.930
It's been a while since we've gotten
to spend New Year's like this, huh?

21:44.930 --> 21:46.660
You're right.

21:47.080 --> 21:51.240
So what exactly did you pray
for back at the shrine?

21:51.240 --> 21:53.710
What? Uh... It's a secret.

21:53.710 --> 21:55.270
But I wanna know!

21:55.270 --> 21:56.720
Come on, tell me!

21:56.720 --> 21:57.950
Quit nagging!

21:57.950 --> 21:59.110
Honestly...

21:59.680 --> 22:02.010
I haven't the faintest idea.

23:35.050 --> 23:40.050
Next Episode: Mahiro Ponders Boobs and Identity

23:35.050 --> 23:40.050
Illustration: Okorinashiyo (Mystery Anime Group)

23:38.360 --> 23:39.680
See you next time!
